schema: "0.3"
id: diag-002-tech-tree
type: svg
service: anthropic

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a technical diagram designer. Create clean, visually appealing SVG
    diagrams for game design documentation. Use warm colors from TheRobotWars
    palette. Dark warm brown (#3E2723) for text. Warm cream (#FFF8E1) background.
  text: |
    Create an SVG diagram showing the Crafting Tech Tree -- the recipe
    progression system from Apprentice through Legendary tier.

    STRUCTURE: Top-down tree with 5 tiers. Each tier is a horizontal band.
    Recipes within a tier are nodes. Lines connect prerequisites.

    TIER 1 - APPRENTICE (warm green #55efc4 band):
    Nodes: Herbal Tea, Clay Pot, Wooden Stool, Basic Toolset, Bread Loaf,
    Simple Cloth, Garden Stakes, Candles, Fishing Line, Soap, Dye Batch,
    Preserved Fruit
    - No prerequisites. Available immediately.
    - Quality range: 1-3 stars

    TIER 2 - JOURNEYMAN (warm blue #74b9ff band):
    Nodes: Copper Chair, Healing Salve, Crystal Lamp, Woven Basket,
    Smoked Fish, Leather Satchel, Iron Tools, Botanical Perfume,
    Glazed Pottery, Herbal Tincture
    - Each requires mastery of 2+ Apprentice recipes
    - Quality range: 2-4 stars
    - Draw prerequisite lines from Apprentice nodes

    TIER 3 - ARTISAN (warm purple #a29bfe band):
    Nodes: Silk Tapestry, Enchanted Furniture, Precision Instruments,
    Alchemical Remedies, Architectural Models, Crystal Optics,
    Musical Instruments, Clockwork Devices
    - Each requires mastery of 2+ Journeyman recipes + faction reputation
    - Quality range: 3-5 stars

    TIER 4 - MASTER (warm gold #ffeaa7 band):
    Nodes: Living Furniture (Fay-enhanced), Resonance Crystal Array,
    Synthetic Calibration Kit, Frontier Navigation Tools,
    Multi-Species Feast, Treaty Documents
    - Each requires mastery of 2+ Artisan recipes + cross-species
      collaboration (materials from 3+ biomes)
    - Quality range: 4-5 stars

    TIER 5 - LEGENDARY (warm rose #fab1a0 band):
    Nodes: The Ashwick Cup (replica), Heartwood Seed,
    Memory Amber Pendant, Signal Decoder
    - Each requires Master mastery + unique world-quest completion
    - Quality: 5 stars only
    - These items have narrative significance

    NODE DESIGN:
    - Rounded rectangle, 120x50px
    - Recipe name in dark brown text
    - Small star indicator showing quality range
    - Biome-origin color accent (left border): green=Hearthfield,
      copper=Copperwood, blue=Ironvale, teal=Brightsand, etc.

    CONNECTING LINES:
    - Warm brown (#8B6F4E) lines with small arrowheads
    - Prerequisite connections should be clear but not cluttered
    - Group related recipes visually (woodwork cluster, alchemy cluster, etc.)

    SIZE: 1400x900 viewport. Dense but readable.
  provider_options:
    model: "claude-sonnet-4-20250514"

output:
  formats:
    - format: svg
  dimensions:
    width: 1400
    height: 900

tags: [diagram, tech-tree, crafting, recipes, progression, system-design, svg]
